    "title": "Help user reason about choice of wallet passphrase",
    "body": "Information was added to a markdown file in https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/28974:\n\nhttps://github.com/bitcoin-core/gui/blob/60afa0b8d71ff0959eac27fe73fadafe72b70cce/doc/managing-wallets.md?plain=1#L127-L141\n\nBut despite concerns (https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/28974#issuecomment-1855661692) never made it to the GUI:\n\n<img width=\"759\" height=\"322\" alt=\"Wallet passphrase entry\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/69b21159-dbca-46db-9184-24041b73a3e9\" />\n\nThe current phrasing dates back to 2011 when wallet key encryption was added in 4e87d341f75f13bbd7d108c31c03886fbc4df56f.\n\nThis topic came up while working on https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/36200\nRelated: https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/issues/18085",
